PATCH WORKFLOW — V5 OVERLAY PATCH FORMAT
============================================================

If user explicitly asks for ACT and patch ZIP:

Do NOT create APPLY_*.ps1 patch scripts.

Patch ZIP format must be overlay folder:

KOST48_V5_X_OVERLAY_PATCH/
├─ backend/
├─ frontend/
├─ scripts/
├─ PATCH_SUMMARY.txt
└─ README_COPY_PASTE_MERGE.txt

User will copy backend/frontend/scripts into project root and choose Merge/Replace in Windows Explorer.

Scripts may be included in /scripts for verify/UAT, but must not be mandatory apply scripts.

Allowed patch summary format:
- PATCH_SUMMARY.txt
- README_COPY_PASTE_MERGE.txt

Do not create .md patch summaries unless user explicitly asks.

For V5.7 ACT specifically, safest expected output is likely:
KOST48_V5_7_WORKSPACE_SHARED_FOUNDATION_OVERLAY_PATCH/
├─ scripts/
