============================================================
BATCH B4 DEPOSIT SETTLEMENT MODEL — DEFERRED
============================================================

Status:
- Future batch.
- Do not mix with V5.7/V5.8/V5.9.

Deposit principle:
- Deposit is a liability, not just a number.
- Checkout final should eventually support refund/full, refund/partial, forfeit, deducted, or pending transfer.

Likely future design:
- DepositTransaction or DepositLog.
- Schema change likely required.
- Must be PLAN first.

Forbidden now:
- Do not add deposit schema in V5.7.
- Do not patch deposit settlement during architecture foundation work.

============================================================
BATCH B5 DAMAGE / PENALTY / INVENTORY CONDITION — DEFERRED
============================================================

Status:
- Future batch.
- Do not mix with V5.7/V5.8/V5.9.

Principle:
- Damage/penalty and inventory movement are different.
- RoomFacility.condition may change when room item is damaged.
- InventoryMovement only happens when physical stock changes.

Forbidden now:
- Do not add damage model in V5.7.
- Do not modify inventory movement logic in V5.7.

